{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f6efe7; --card:#fff7ee; --accent:#7a4b2b; --accent-2:#b07a4a; --muted:#6b6b6b; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:12px; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0; background:var(--bg) url('assets/img/pattern.svg'); background-size:450px; color:#2b2b2b; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
    }
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.75),rgba(255,255,255,0.92));backdrop-filter: blur(6px);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:34px auto;padding:26px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:22px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(122,75,43,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;color:var(--accent)}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px 0;color:#4a4a4a}

    /* Session Planner */
    .planner .row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .pill{border-radius:999px;padding:8px 12px;background:rgba(186,146,118,0.12);border:1px solid rgba(160,110,70,0.08);font-weight:600;color:var(--accent)}
    label{display:block;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:6px;color:#35403f}
    select,input[type="text"],textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:none;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .btn.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(122,75,43,0.12)}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),rgba(255,255,255,0.4));padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed rgba(0,0,0,0.06);min-height:120px}
    .checks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
    footer{margin-top:28px;padding:20px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.6),transparent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}

    @media(max-width:940px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.brand{gap:8px}.logo{width:40px;height:40px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">H</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Neighborhood integrative care</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <a href="contact.html" style="margin-left:8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="grid">
      <section class="card">
        <h1>Let's plan something real</h1>
        <p class="lead">A quick, practical sketch of an initial session and the follow-up that makes it useful. Use the planner and the whole-person inventory to create a shareable summary you can bring to your first visit.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:12px;">
          <strong>Contact</strong>
          <p class="small">Call: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
          <p class="small">Serving: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Appointments by video or in-person</p>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:18px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)">

        <div class="planner">
          <label for="goal">Primary goal for care</label>
          <select id="goal">
            <option value="Improve sleep consistency">Improve sleep consistency</option>
            <option value="Reduce daily stress and overwhelm">Reduce daily stress and overwhelm</option>
            <option value="Support energy and digestion">Support energy and digestion</option>
            <option value="Manage chronic pain">Manage chronic pain</option>
            <option value="Clarify next steps after a diagnosis">Clarify next steps after a diagnosis</option>
            <option value="Other">Other</option>
          </select>

          <div class="row" style="margin-top:10px">
            <div style="flex:1">
              <label for="sessionType">Session type</label>
              <select id="sessionType">
                <option>Comprehensive intake (60-75 min)</option>
                <option>Focused follow-up (30-40 min)</option>
                <option>Brief check-in (15-20 min)</option>
                <option>Care coordination consult</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div style="width:140px">
              <label for="duration">Planned duration</label>
              <select id="duration">
                <option>60 minutes</option>
                <option>45 minutes</option>
                <option>30 minutes</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="frequency">Preferred follow-up rhythm</label>
          <select id="frequency">
            <option>Weekly for 6 weeks</option>
            <option>Biweekly for 8 weeks</option>
            <option>Monthly for 3 months</option>
            <option>Ad hoc as needed</option>
          </select>

          <label for="notes">Notes & priorities (what matters most right now)</label>
          <textarea id="notes" placeholder="Brief description: symptoms, timing, what's been tried..."></textarea>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
            <button class="btn" id="buildPlan">Plan my session</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" id="clearPlanner">Clear</button>
            <div style="margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Export: plaintext summary</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <label class="small">Plan preview</label>
            <div id="planOutput" class="output" aria-live="polite">Use the planner and click "Plan my session" to generate a concise plan here.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn" id="copyPlan">Copy summary</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" id="downloadPlan">Download .txt</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--accent-2)">Whole-person inventory</h2>
        <p class="small">Quick checkboxes to sketch the consultation agenda and a follow-up cadence that fits your life. This is a preparatory exercise — not diagnostic.</p>

        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <div class="checks">
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep" class="wp"> Sleep patterns & quality</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Nutrition" class="wp"> Nutrition & appetite</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Movement" class="wp"> Movement & aches</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Stress" class="wp"> Stress & mood</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Relationships" class="wp"> Relationships & support</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Work" class="wp"> Work & schedule</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Environment" class="wp"> Home & environment</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Spirituality" class="wp"> Meaning, values, rest</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Symptoms" class="wp"> Specific symptoms & history</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" value="Medications" class="wp"> Medications & supplements</label>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px">
            <button class="btn" id="generateAgenda">Generate agenda</button>
            <button class="btn secondary" id="clearChecks">Clear</button>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:14px">
            <label class="small">Consultation agenda</label>
            <div id="agendaOutput" class="output">Select areas above and click "Generate agenda" to see a suggested meeting agenda and follow-up cadence tailored to what you checked.</div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
              <button class="btn" id="copyAgenda">Copy agenda</button>
              <button class="btn secondary" id="saveAgenda">Save as note</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <footer>
          <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">No medical promises — educational guidance only. For urgent concerns, contact local emergency services.</div>
          <a href="book.html" class="btn">Plan a visit</a>
        </footer>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section style="margin-top:20px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin:0;color:var(--accent)">Why use these tools before our first meeting?</h3>
      <p class="small" style="margin-top:8px">They help clarify what matters most, keep the first visit focused, and create a follow-up rhythm you can actually use. The outputs are shareable notes you can copy into messages or bring to your appointment.</p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <script>
    // Simple helper
    function el(id){return document.getElementById(id)}

    // Planner
    var build = el('buildPlan');
    var clear = el('clearPlanner');
    var copyPlan = el('copyPlan');
    var downloadPlan = el('downloadPlan');
    var planOutput = el('planOutput');

    build.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var goal = el('goal').value;
      var type = el('sessionType').value;
      var duration = el('duration').value;
      var freq = el('frequency').value;
      var notes = el('notes').value.trim();

      var now = new Date().toLocaleDateString();
      var summary = '';
      summary += 'Client sketch — ' + now + '\n';
      summary += 'Primary goal: ' + goal + '\n';
      summary += 'Planned session: ' + type + ' (' + duration + ')\n';
      summary += 'Follow-up rhythm: ' + freq + '\n\n';
      summary += 'Top priorities for first session:\n';
      summary += '- Brief history & timeline of current concern\n';
      summary += '- Relevant daily rhythms (sleep, meals, movement)\n';
      summary += '- What has been tried & responses\n';
      if(notes) summary += '\nClient notes:\n' + notes + '\n';
      summary += '\nNotes for practitioner: use an educational, whole-person frame and create measurable first-step actions.\n';

      planOutput.textContent = summary;
    });

    clear.addEventListener('click', function(){
      el('goal').selectedIndex = 0; el('sessionType').selectedIndex = 0; el('duration').selectedIndex = 0; el('frequency').selectedIndex = 0; el('notes').value=''; planOutput.textContent = 'Use the planner and click "Plan my session" to generate a concise plan here.';
    });

    copyPlan.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = planOutput.textContent || '';
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){
        copyPlan.textContent = 'Copied'; setTimeout(()=>copyPlan.textContent='Copy summary',1200);
      }, function(){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); });
    });

    downloadPlan.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = planOutput.textContent || '';
      var blob = new Blob([text], {type: 'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
      var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      var a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = url; a.download = 'session-plan.txt'; document.body.appendChild(a); a.click(); a.remove(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

    // Whole-person inventory -> agenda
    var gen = el('generateAgenda');
    var clearChecks = el('clearChecks');
    var agendaOutput = el('agendaOutput');
    var copyAgenda = el('copyAgenda');
    var saveAgenda = el('saveAgenda');

    function buildAgenda(){
      var checks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.wp:checked')).map(function(i){return i.value});
      if(checks.length===0){ agendaOutput.textContent = 'No areas selected. Choose a few items that feel most pressing and click "Generate agenda".'; return; }

      // Prioritize: sleep, symptoms, stress, nutrition, movement, relationships, work, environment, meds, spirituality
      var order = ['Symptoms','Sleep','Stress','Nutrition','Medications','Movement','Work','Relationships','Environment','Spirituality'];
      checks.sort(function(a,b){return order.indexOf(a)-order.indexOf(b)});

      var lines = [];
      lines.push('Suggested consultation agenda (concise):');
      lines.push('1) Opening — 5 minutes: current top concern, immediate safety or urgent needs.');
      var idx=2;
      checks.forEach(function(item){
        lines.push(idx + ') ' + item + ': 10-15 minutes — focused questions, measures (sleep logs, meals, pain rating), and one small testable change.');
        idx++;
      });
      lines.push(idx + ') Practical plan & education — 10 minutes: one concrete habit to try, resources, and simple monitoring.');
      lines.push('\nFollow-up cadence recommendation:');

      // Determine cadence logic
      var cadence = '';
      if(checks.includes('Symptoms') || checks.includes('Medications')){
        cadence = 'Weekly or biweekly follow-ups for 4–8 weeks to monitor symptoms and medication interactions.';
      } else if(checks.includes('Stress') || checks.includes('Sleep')){
        cadence = 'Biweekly for 6–10 weeks to support behavioral changes and adjust pacing.';
      } else {
        cadence = 'Monthly check-ins for 2–3 months to track steady, small changes and adjust as needed.';
      }
      lines.push('- ' + cadence);
      lines.push('\nPractical handoffs:');
      lines.push('- Identify 1 measurable goal and a 1-week micro-test.');
      lines.push('- Share plan summary with the client via secure message or bring to the next visit.');
      lines.push('\nNote: This is educational planning. For urgent concerns or changes in health, seek immediate medical advice.');

      agendaOutput.textContent = lines.join('\n');
    }

    gen.addEventListener('click', buildAgenda);
    clearChecks.addEventListener('click', function(){ document.querySelectorAll('.wp').forEach(function(i){i.checked=false}); agendaOutput.textContent = 'Select areas above and click "Generate agenda" to see a suggested meeting agenda and follow-up cadence tailored to what you checked.'; });

    copyAgenda.addEventListener('click', function(){ var text = agendaOutput.textContent || ''; navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function(){ copyAgenda.textContent='Copied'; setTimeout(()=>copyAgenda.textContent='Copy agenda',1200); }, function(){ alert('Copy failed — select and copy manually.'); }); });

    saveAgenda.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var text = agendaOutput.textContent || '';
      if(!text) return; // nothing
      // quick client-side save using localStorage
      var key = 'hp_agenda_' + (new Date()).toISOString();
      localStorage.setItem(key, text);
      saveAgenda.textContent = 'Saved'; setTimeout(()=>saveAgenda.textContent='Save as note',1200);
    });

    // Accessibility: allow Enter to trigger planner
    el('notes').addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.metaKey && e.key==='Enter'){ build.click(); } });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page for holistic_medicine site — chunk 4

This bundle contains two files for the contact page and developer notes.

Files:
- contact.html — Full contact/connect page with two interactive tools:
  1) Session Planner: build a short, plaintext session summary you can copy or download. Fields include primary goal, session type, duration, follow-up rhythm, and client notes. Click "Plan my session" to generate a ready-to-share text block. Copy and Download buttons are provided.
  2) Whole-person inventory: a checklist of life areas (sleep, nutrition, movement, stress, relationships, work, environment, spirituality, symptoms, medications). Click "Generate agenda" to produce a prioritized consultation agenda and a suggested follow-up cadence. Copy and Save (localStorage) actions available.

Design notes:
- Layout family: earthy_warm, warm_storyteller voice.
- Nav label set differs from default: Start, Offerings, Conditions, Method, Investment, Our Story, Book a Visit, Connect.
- Uses placeholders that must be replaced at build or runtime: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.
- No external assets; background references assets/img/pattern.svg (unique SVG expected in another chunk).
- Tone and copy follow educational, non-curative guidance; includes a safety disclaimer in the UI.

Developer notes:
- All interactions are client-side. No server required.
- Copy uses navigator.clipboard; Download uses Blob and object URLs.
- "Save as note" stores the generated agenda in localStorage with a timestamp key.
- To change labels, update the HTML nav or button text.

How to run locally:
1) Place this file alongside the rest of the site files and ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists in that path.
2) Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari).
3) Use the Session Planner and Whole-person inventory to produce text outputs. Use the Copy or Download buttons to export.

Accessibility:
- Outputs use aria-live and semantic elements.
- Buttons are keyboard accessible. Cmd/Ctrl+Enter in the notes field triggers the planner build.

Notes on constraints:
- This chunk intentionally only includes contact.html and this README. The global site includes other pages listed in the project brief.
- The page avoids certain recent headline phrases as requested and keeps unique metaphors and CTA phrasing (e.g., "Plan my session").

If you need an alternate export format (PDF or printable layout), I can add a client-side print stylesheet or a small JS routine to format the text for printing."}
BUNDLE_END
